The PIR313 Multi-sensor is used to measure the ambient temperature, humidity, motion and illuminance. It is available to receive notifications from the mobile app.

## Key Features

- ZigBee 3.0
- PIR motion detection
- Temperature and humidity measuring
- Illuminance measurement
- Long battery life
- Low battery alerts
- Anti-tamper
- Sleek design
